# SA:COOP reads this file for the skins of this folder: a line of the game's peds.ide each, by the skin's name
# (the second word). Of it the ped type (its sex), the walk set and the voices are used for a player wearing it.
# The lines of the authors of Criminal Peds Vary (wizvich); their textures here are only the ones the models use.
# AOD1, AOD2, AOD3, AOD5, AOD6, AOD7, AOD9, AOD10, AOD11, AOD13, AOD14, AOD15, AOD17, AOD18, AOD19: PED_TYPE_GANG
# in the authors' file, PED_TYPE_GEN here, the table of their voices: the game looks a voice up only in its type's
# table.
# AOD15, AOD16: GANG10 in the authors' file, CIVFEMALE here: women (female textures and voice), and the type
# gives a player's skin its sex.
